## 22. Local-First Security Flow
```
User ──▶ S.H.A.D.E. ──▶ Local Detection ──▶ Local Encrypted Vault ──▶ Synthetic Representation ──▶ External System

External Response ──▶ Token Detection ──▶ Local Auth Check ──▶ Local Vault ──▶ Real Value ──▶ Authorized Action
```

